  "description": "Divided per saltire by a white saltire, light blue above, red below, orange at the hoist and dark green at the fly.",
  "history": "The official flag of Baix Pallars is oblong, of proportions two high by three long, quartered per saltire, with the upper triangle light blue, the lower red, the hoist orange and the fly dark green, with a full white saltire; approved by the municipal council on 14 July 2022, approved by the Department of the Presidency on 12 April 2023 and published in the DOGC on 18 April 2023.",
